OL,3,GNEWSAMine site takeover parties told to
OL,4,A'get a move on'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupporters of plans for the National
OL,7,FTrust to take over a tourist attraction
OL,8,Fhave asked all involved to "get a move
OL,9,Fon".
OL,11,FThe Heartlands mining heritage centre
OL,12,Fin Pool, near Camborne in Cornwall,
OL,13,Fclosed in January 2024. In February
OL,14,F2026, the charity announced it would be
OL,15,Ftaking over the site from Cornwall
OL,16,FCouncil, with negotiations expected to
OL,17,Fconclude "this summer".
OL,19,FCritics said that, while the council
OL,20,Fhad been maintaining the site, there
OL,21,Fhad been evidence of incidents of
OL,22,Fvandalism.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
